cmd-setbatterypercent-desc = Drains or recharges a battery by entity uid and percentage, i.e.: forall with Battery do setbatterypercent $ID 0
cmd-setbatterypercent-help = 用法：setbatterypercent<id> <percent>
cmd-setbatterypercent-battery-not-found = 未找到標識碼為 { $id } 的電池。
cmd-setbatterypercent-not-valid-percent = { $arg } 不是有效的浮點數（百分比）。
